    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5908" root="جعر" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْعَرٌ</span></b>  The <i>rump,</i> or <i>podex;</i> or the <i>anus;</i> [in
the present day, the latter;] syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُبُرٌ</span>; (S, K;) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَعْرَآءُ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِعِرَّى</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاعِرَةٌ</span></b>  the <i>same;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتٌ</span>; (K;) or the last (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جاعرة</span>), as some say, <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلْقَةُ الدُّبُرِ</span>. (S, K.)

